This source code is publicly viewable, but it is not free to use.

You may:
  • read and study the source code;
  • use and try out the app at its published address, including to assess
    my work, for example as part of a hiring process;
  • quote individual excerpts with attribution, for example in a review or
    assessment.

You may not, without my prior written permission:
  • copy, modify, distribute or incorporate the code, in whole or in part,
    into your own projects;
  • host, sell or otherwise commercially exploit the app or any version
    derived from it;
  • use the app's texts, feeling lexicon, questions, name or design for
    other products.

Forking through GitHub's own feature is possible under GitHub's Terms of
Service. It grants no rights beyond those listed above.

The app is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It is not a
medical device and replaces neither diagnosis nor therapy.

For enquiries about use, licensing or collaboration, please get in touch via
my GitHub profile: https://github.com/ryanodo-twentysix

